title ALES165 — Lotus's stereo_hold_env: the held envelope follower carried into stereo, one linked detector given the hold stage — the patient time base the whole stereo held-dynamics family waits for
prompt Take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first on the road past BUHR; approve my own design rounds; double-seat new visions; a breach rename records a cairn first; send each finished increment as its own signed round; stop at the custody gates; if only gates remain, touch .loop-gates-only and print GATES-ONLY.
think Aligned the compass: REMEMBER's living edge is the Lotus (ALES) ladder, Season C of the six-season double-seat. ALES160–164 carried the plain follower and the whole time-varying quartet (compress/gate/limit/expand) into stereo. The mono family carries one more stage the stereo family has not crossed — the HOLD (ALES56), the patience between attack and release.
think Crux-first and dependency-first, the hold's carrier comes before its four spenders: rather than re-invent the hold inside the coming stereo held compressor, gate, limiter, and expander, give the LINKED detector the held patience once, so all four read one proven linked-held time base. Exact stereo mirror of ALES56 over the linked key of ALES160 — the same move that opened the plain stereo family at ALES160.
think The shape fuses two proofs whole: stereo_env_step_hold computes the clamped linked key max(|L|,|R|) exactly as ALES160, then carries ALES56's hold reasoning over it (pin the linked peak on a fall while the shared countdown runs, rearm on a rise, delegate every move to ALES52's env_step). One detector, one SHARED hold countdown — holding each channel on its own countdown would let them release on different samples and tear the image. The one held value written to both channels.
obs GREEN first run. Six laws GREEN on metal: the linked held detector law (the shared held curve == ALES56's mono hold_follow of a synthetic per-sample linked-key clip byte for byte, both channels equal it, the independent per-channel held follow differing); the zero-hold law (hold=0 reduces to ALES160's plain stereo_follow byte for byte on both, run against the real tool — the held rung's no-hold limit exactly the plain linked rung already proven); the hold-delays-release law (a larger shared hold pins the linked peak longer, monotone, strictly higher at the first falling sample); the hold-exact law (a linked peak pinned for precisely hold samples then released, whole curve byte for byte on both); the carry law (split mid-hold == whole once on both, env AND hold_left carrying); the balance/silence/atomicity(three refusals)/degenerate law.
obs StereoHoldEnvError = hold_env.HoldEnvError (BadCoeff, BadHold, BadRange) reused whole; the fusion adds no fault. Purely local, siloed to lotus/; envelope in [0, sample_max] (fits i16), hold bounded by max_clip, no overflow. The curve is not yet routed into a gain — driving the stereo held compressor/gate/limiter/expander from it is the next rung. No custody gate reached — a self-approved design round. TAME style bans clean; the new module carries asserts (not on the zero-assert ratchet).
