recommend keep-going — the linked held time base is proven; the next crux on the ALES ladder is the held-dynamics family that spends it (stereo_compress_env_hold, then the held gate/limit/expand), the same fusion of ALES161–164's linked gains over the added hold, single-module, policy written, no seam.
